it, is that once this happens...

837
00:47:10,354 --> 00:47:11,354
It's finished.

838
00:47:11,354 --> 00:47:12,354
...there is no reversion.

839
00:47:12,354 --> 00:47:16,354
Of course not.

840
00:47:16,354 --> 00:47:18,354
Say, for instance, sir...

841
00:47:18,354 --> 00:47:20,354
It isn't something that one has to keep up.

842
00:47:20,354 --> 00:47:22,354
Of course not.

843
00:47:22,354 --> 00:47:26,354
Well, fine, I'm delighted we've established that.

844
00:47:26,354 --> 00:47:32,354
But say, for instance, what happened in 1928,

845
00:47:34,354 --> 00:47:39,354
I happened to be the head of a tremendous organisation,

846
00:47:39,354 --> 00:47:42,354
a religious organisation,

847
00:47:42,354 --> 00:47:47,354
and I saw around me various religious organisations,

848
00:47:47,354 --> 00:47:50,354
sects, Catholic, Protestant,

849
00:47:50,354 --> 00:47:55,354
and I see all trying to find truth.

850
00:47:55,354 --> 00:47:59,354
I said, no organisation can lead man to truth.

851
00:47:59,354 --> 00:48:03,354
So I dissolved it.

852
00:48:03,354 --> 00:48:07,354
Property, an enormous business, all that.

853
00:48:07,354 --> 00:48:10,354
I can never go back to it.

854
00:48:10,354 --> 00:48:13,354
When you see something as poison,

855
00:48:13,354 --> 00:48:18,354
you won't take it again.

856
00:48:18,354 --> 00:48:20,354
You say, by Jove, I've made a mistake,

857
00:48:20,354 --> 00:48:23,354
I should go back and...

858
00:48:23,354 --> 00:48:28,354
It is, sir, it's like seeing danger.

859
00:48:28,354 --> 00:48:35,354
When you see danger, you never go near it again.

860
00:48:38,354 --> 00:48:40,354
I hope I won't annoy you

861
00:48:40,354 --> 00:48:42,354
by talking about words here again.

862
00:48:42,354 --> 00:48:45,854
But you know, so many

863
00:48:45,854 --> 00:48:49,354
of the things that you say

864
00:48:49,354 --> 00:48:52,354
cast a light on...

865
00:48:52,354 --> 00:48:53,354
No, no.

866
00:48:53,354 --> 00:49:01,354
...common terms which, for me at least, illuminate them.

867
00:49:01,354 --> 00:49:04,354
They sound altogether different

868
00:49:04,354 --> 00:49:07,354
from the way they used to be heard.

869
00:49:07,354 --> 00:49:09,354
For instance, we say in English, don't we,

870
00:49:09,354 --> 00:49:11,354
practice makes perfect.

871
00:49:11,354 --> 00:49:17,354
Now, obviously, this...

872
00:49:17,354 --> 00:49:22,354
this can't be the case if we mean by practice.

873
00:49:22,354 --> 00:49:24,354
That we're repeating something.

874
00:49:24,354 --> 00:49:29,354
But if we mean by practice,

875
00:49:29,354 --> 00:49:34,354
the Greek praxis, which is concerned directly with act,

876
00:49:34,354 --> 00:49:37,354
not repetition, but with act,

877
00:49:37,354 --> 00:49:40,354
then to say it makes perfect

878
00:49:40,354 --> 00:49:45,354
doesn't refer to time at all.

879
00:49:45,354 --> 00:49:50,354
It's that upon the instant the act is performed,

880
00:49:50,354 --> 00:49:51,354
perfection is.

881
00:49:51,354 --> 00:49:56,354
Now, I'm sorry, but I used the word instant again.

882
00:49:56,354 --> 00:50:00,354
And I understand why that's awkward.

883
00:50:00,354 --> 00:50:09,354
But I think in our communication,

884
00:50:09,354 --> 00:50:12,354
the concern for the word here

885
00:50:12,354 --> 00:50:20,354
is one that surely is productive,

886
00:50:20,354 --> 00:50:23,354
because one can open himself to a word.

887
00:50:23,354 --> 00:50:26,354
And if one sees the word that way,

888
00:50:26,354 --> 00:50:30,354
then it appears that there's a whole host

889
00:50:30,354 --> 00:50:34,354
of phenomena which suddenly acquire

890
00:50:34,354 --> 00:50:37,354
a very magical significance.

891
00:50:37,354 --> 00:50:41,354
Not magical in the sense of enchantment,

892
00:50:41,354 --> 00:50:44,354
but they open a door,

893
00:50:44,354 --> 00:50:47,354
which when walked into

894
00:50:47,354 --> 00:50:49,354
immediately situates him

895
00:50:49,354 --> 00:50:54,354
in the crisis in such a way that

896
00:50:54,354 --> 00:51:00,354
he attains to this that you call

897
00:51:00,354 --> 00:51:04,354
the one alone,

898
00:51:04,354 --> 00:51:07,354
the unique,

899
00:51:07,354 --> 00:51:10,354
which comes into being.

900
00:51:10,354 --> 00:51:14,354
So, sir, can we now go back

901
00:51:14,354 --> 00:51:17,354
or go forward to the question

902
00:51:17,354 --> 00:51:23,354
of freedom and responsibility in relationship?

903
00:51:23,354 --> 00:51:25,354
That's what we left out yesterday.

904
00:51:25,354 --> 00:51:26,354
Right.

905
00:51:26,354 --> 00:51:31,354
Yes, and that was quoted from the chapter on freedom.

906
00:51:31,354 --> 00:51:34,354
Yes.

907
00:51:34,354 --> 00:51:37,354
First of all, can we go into this question

908
00:51:37,354 --> 00:51:43,354
of what it is to be responsible?

909
00:51:43,354 --> 00:51:45,354
I should like that.

910
00:51:45,354 --> 00:51:47,354
Because I think that is

911
00:51:47,354 --> 00:51:50,354
what we are missing in this world,

912
00:51:50,354 --> 00:51:52,354
what is happening now.

913
00:51:52,354 --> 00:51:56,354
We don't feel responsible.

914
00:51:56,354 --> 00:52:02,354
We don't feel we are responsible because

915
00:52:02,354 --> 00:52:05,354
the people in position,

916
00:52:05,354 --> 00:52:08,354
in authority, politically, religiously,

917
00:52:08,354 --> 00:52:12,354
are responsible. We are not.

918
00:52:12,354 --> 00:52:16,354
That is the general feeling that's all over the world.

919
00:52:16,354 --> 00:52:17,354
Those over there have been delegated

920
00:52:17,354 --> 00:52:20,354
to do a job by me.

921
00:52:20,354 --> 00:52:24,354
And scientists, politicians,

922
00:52:24,354 --> 00:52:26,354
the educational people,

923
00:52:26,354 --> 00:52:29,354
the religious people,

924
00:52:29,354 --> 00:52:31,354
they are responsible,

925
00:52:31,354 --> 00:52:35,354
but I know nothing about it, I just follow.

926
00:52:35,354 --> 00:52:37,354
That is the general attitude

927
00:52:37,354 --> 00:52:38,354
right through the world.

928
00:52:38,354 --> 00:52:41,354
Oh, yes.

929
00:52:41,354 --> 00:52:44,354
Solzhenitsyn, you follow the whole thing.

930
00:52:44,354 --> 00:52:45,354
Yes, right.

931
00:52:45,354 --> 00:52:48,354
One feels he gets off scot-free that way

932
00:52:48,354 --> 00:52:50,354
because it is the other one's fault.

933
00:52:50,354 --> 00:52:55,354
Yes. So, I make myself irresponsible.

934
00:52:55,354 --> 00:52:58,354
By delegating responsibility to you,

935
00:52:58,354 --> 00:53:02,354
I become irresponsible.

936
00:53:02,354 --> 00:53:04,354
Whereas now we are saying

937
00:53:04,354 --> 00:53:12,354
nobody is responsible except you.

938
00:53:12,354 --> 00:53:14,354
Because you are the world,

939
00:53:14,354 --> 00:53:16,354
the world is you.

940
00:53:16,354 --> 00:53:18,354
You have created this mess,

941
00:53:18,354 --> 00:53:23,354
you alone can bring about clarity.

942
00:53:23,354 --> 00:53:26,354
Therefore you are totally, utterly,

943
00:53:26,354 --> 00:53:29,354
completely responsible,

944
00:53:29,354 --> 00:53:33,354
and nobody else.

945
00:53:33,354 --> 00:53:38,354
Now, that means you have to be

946
00:53:38,354 --> 00:53:42,354
a light to yourself,

947
00:53:42,354 --> 00:53:44,354
not the light

948
00:53:44,354 --> 00:53:46,354
of a professor, or an analyst,

949
00:53:46,354 --> 00:53:48,354
or a psychologist,

950
00:53:48,354 --> 00:53:50,354
or the light of Jesus,

951
00:53:50,354 --> 00:53:52,354
or the light of the Buddha.

952
00:53:52,354 --> 00:53:56,354
You have to be a light to yourself

953
00:53:56,354 --> 00:54:03,354
in a world that is utterly becoming dark.

954
00:54:03,354 --> 00:54:06,354
That means you have to be responsible.

955
00:54:06,354 --> 00:54:11,354
Now, what does that word mean?

956
00:54:11,354 --> 00:54:13,354
It means really,

957
00:54:13,354 --> 00:54:24,354
to respond totally, adequately to every challenge.

958
00:54:24,354 --> 00:54:28,354
You cannot possibly respond adequately

959
00:54:28,354 --> 00:54:36,354
if you are rooted in the past.

960
00:54:36,354 --> 00:54:41,354
Because the challenge is new,

961
00:54:41,354 --> 00:54:43,354
otherwise it is not a challenge.

962
00:54:43,354 --> 00:54:45,354
A crisis is new,

963
00:54:45,354 --> 00:54:48,354
otherwise it is not a crisis.

964
00:54:48,354 --> 00:54:55,354
So, if I respond to a crisis

965
00:54:55,354 --> 00:54:58,354
in terms of a preconceived plan,

966
00:54:58,354 --> 00:55:01,354
which the communists are doing,

967
00:55:01,354 --> 00:55:03,354
or the Catholics, or the Protestants,

968
00:55:03,354 --> 00:55:04,354
and so on, so on,

969
00:55:04,354 --> 00:55:07,354
then they are not responding totally

970
00:55:07,354 --> 00:55:12,354
and adequately to the challenge.

971
00:55:12,354 --> 00:55:15,354
This takes me back to something

972
00:55:15,354 --> 00:55:18,354
I think that is very germane

973
00:55:18,354 --> 00:55:21,354
in the dramatic situation

974
00:55:21,354 --> 00:55:24,354
of confrontation between

975
00:55:24,354 --> 00:55:26,354
the soldier

976
00:55:26,354 --> 00:55:29,354
and the Lord Krishna

977
00:55:29,354 --> 00:55:33,354
in the Gita.

978
00:55:33,354 --> 00:55:38,354
Arjuna, the general of the army,

979
00:55:38,354 --> 00:55:41,354
says to Krishna,

980
00:55:41,354 --> 00:55:44,354
tell me definitely what to do

981
00:55:44,354 --> 00:55:46,354
and I will do it.

982
00:55:46,354 --> 00:55:48,354
Now, Krishna doesn't turn around

983
00:55:48,354 --> 00:55:49,354
and say to him in the next verse,

984
00:55:49,354 --> 00:55:51,354
I am not going to tell you what to do.

985
00:55:51,354 --> 00:55:53,354
But of course, at that point

986
00:55:53,354 --> 00:55:56,354
he simply doesn't tell him what to do.

987
00:55:56,354 --> 00:56:00,354
And one of the great Sanskrit scholars

988
00:56:00,354 --> 00:56:02,354
has pointed out that

989
00:56:02,354 --> 00:56:04,354
that is an irresponsible reaction

990
00:56:04,354 --> 00:56:06,354
on the part of the teacher.

991
00:56:06,354 --> 00:56:08,354
But if I am understanding you correctly,

992
00:56:08,354 --> 00:56:10,354
he couldn't have done otherwise.

993
00:56:10,354 --> 00:56:14,354
When that man put that question,

994
00:56:14,354 --> 00:56:17,354
he is putting a question out of irresponsibility.

995
00:56:17,354 --> 00:56:20,354
Of course. A refusal to be responsible.

996
00:56:20,354 --> 00:56:23,354
Exactly. A refusal to be responsible.

997
00:56:23,354 --> 00:56:26,354
That's why, sir,

998
00:56:26,354 --> 00:56:32,354
responsibility means total commitment.

999
00:56:32,354 --> 00:56:33,354
Total commitment.

1000
00:56:33,354 --> 00:56:38,354
Total commitment to the challenge.

1001
00:56:38,354 --> 00:56:40,354
Responding to the challenge

1002
00:56:40,354 --> 00:56:46,354
adequately, completely to a crisis.

1003
00:56:46,354 --> 00:56:52,354
That is, the word responsibility means that.

1004
00:56:52,354 --> 00:56:55,354
To respond.

1005
00:56:55,354 --> 00:57:02,354
I cannot respond completely if I am frightened.

1006
00:57:02,354 --> 00:57:05,354
Or I cannot respond completely

1007
00:57:05,354 --> 00:57:09,354
if I am seeking pleasure.

1008
00:57:10,354 --> 00:57:13,354
I cannot respond totally

1009
00:57:13,354 --> 00:57:19,354
if my action is routine,

1010
00:57:19,354 --> 00:57:26,354
is repetitive, is traditional, is conditioned.

1011
00:57:26,354 --> 00:57:31,354
So to respond adequately to a challenge means

1012
00:57:31,354 --> 00:57:38,354
the me, which is the past, must end.

1013
00:57:38,354 --> 00:57:40,354
And at this point, Arjuna,

1014
00:57:40,354 --> 00:57:43,354
the past wants it continued right down the line.

1015
00:57:43,354 --> 00:57:48,354
That's what everybody wants, sir.

1016
00:57:48,354 --> 00:57:51,354
Politically, look what is happening in this country

1017
00:57:51,354 --> 00:57:53,354
and elsewhere.

1018
00:57:53,354 --> 00:57:58,354
We don't feel responsible.

1019
00:57:58,354 --> 00:58:01,354
We don't feel responsible

1020
00:58:01,354 --> 00:58:05,354
to how we bring our children up.

1021
00:58:05,354 --> 00:58:09,354
I understand. I really do, I think.

1022
00:58:09,354 --> 00:58:12,354
In our next conversation,

1023
00:58:12,354 --> 00:58:14,354
I'd really like to continue this

1024
00:58:14,354 --> 00:58:16,354
in terms of the phrase that we sometimes use,

1025
00:58:16,354 --> 00:58:19,354
being responsible for my action.

1026
00:58:19,354 --> 00:58:21,354
But that doesn't seem to be saying exactly

1027
00:58:21,354 --> 00:58:22,354
what you're saying at all.

1028
00:58:22,354 --> 00:58:23,354
As a matter of fact, it seems

1029
00:58:23,354 --> 00:58:24,354
to be quite wide of the mark.

1030
00:58:24,354 --> 00:58:25,354
Quite wide.

1031
00:58:25,354 --> 00:58:27,354
Good. Let's do that.

